{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the sandals of Perseus...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Growing up on a quiet island adrift in the Aegean, you thought   life would be simple. You were wrong. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You assumed you would follow the humble fisherman's trade... but now a demand has been made of you: Bring back the head of Medusa, the monster whose gaze can turn men to stone. Your mother Danae knew this day would come. She tells you the truth at last - your father is Zeus, king of the gods. And there is more: The oracle of Delphi said you are destined to kill your grandfather, the king of Argos.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A fish-boy from the islands and a prince born of Zeus, your two lives couldn't have less in common. And now you're being thrust into the strange new world of the mainland to find the lair of Medusa. The gods watch you. The king fears you. And they say no man can escape his fate...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/230777b8687deb6b9e1406ae4fc57d36.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/230777b8687deb6b9e1406ae4fc57d36.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/230777b8687deb6b9e1406ae4fc57d36.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aletheia: Prophecy of Perseus</strong> is a new RPG that puts you in control of the legendary hero as he embarks on his impossible quest - to slay the gorgon Medusa and fulfil his destiny!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FAITHFUL ADAPTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tale of <strong>Perseus</strong>, slayer of Medusa and savior of Andromeda, is one of the most beloved stories in Greek mythology. Many poets celebrated it, and it was a great favourite in Ancient Greece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We here at <strong>Absent Dragon</strong>\u00a0present an RPG\u00a0about Perseus that stays true to the original myth, drawing upon the works of Apollodorus, Hesiod, Pindar and other classical texts.\u00a0The game has been meticulously researched to ensure it\u2019s as faithful as possible not only to the tale of Perseus, but to Greek mythology as a whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/a704cb4692a3fc587daa733b964d5145.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/a704cb4692a3fc587daa733b964d5145.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/a704cb4692a3fc587daa733b964d5145.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURN-BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging turn-based combat with an action-point economy. Avoid attacks of opportunity, position your party to outflank your foes, and use blessings from the gods to slaughter them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/dfdba5c8717a27df598c53fdb72bf224.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/dfdba5c8717a27df598c53fdb72bf224.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/dfdba5c8717a27df598c53fdb72bf224.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REACTIVE QUESTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive questing with multiple solutions. <strong>SNEAK</strong>, <strong>TALK</strong> or <strong>FIGHT</strong> your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/333beb23069288c14b375779284a6b73.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/333beb23069288c14b375779284a6b73.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/333beb23069288c14b375779284a6b73.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DETAILED CHARACTER CREATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed character creation. Determine your upbringing, background, skills and attributes. Will you be a hunter? Philosopher?\u00a0Wrestler? Something else?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/0ba3646d91d98f5d51d7e851f90d529d.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/0ba3646d91d98f5d51d7e851f90d529d.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/0ba3646d91d98f5d51d7e851f90d529d.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME YOUR LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perseus's adventure can end in multiple ways,  each a testament to your journey. Will Perseus return a hero, a king... or something else entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/6df56a2ca7954282a15fa3d2cfb16e16.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/6df56a2ca7954282a15fa3d2cfb16e16.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/6df56a2ca7954282a15fa3d2cfb16e16.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3633220?t=1763342320","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/66340285ad5e51b8f8c4ef1effc25c63e6835756/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763342320","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/e1d4231d233d02362c123d556711e80fd2f9122f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763342320","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/e1d4231d233d02362c123d556711e80fd2f9122f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763342320","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages. It contains General Mature Content, Frequent Violence and may include Nudity."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step into the sandals of Perseus...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Growing up on a quiet island adrift in the Aegean, you thought   life would be simple. You were wrong. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You assumed you would follow the humble fisherman's trade... but now a demand has been made of you: Bring back the head of Medusa, the monster whose gaze can turn men to stone. Your mother Danae knew this day would come. She tells you the truth at last - your father is Zeus, king of the gods. And there is more: The oracle of Delphi said you are destined to kill your grandfather, the king of Argos.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A fish-boy from the islands and a prince born of Zeus, your two lives couldn't have less in common. And now you're being thrust into the strange new world of the mainland to find the lair of Medusa. The gods watch you. The king fears you. And they say no man can escape his fate...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/230777b8687deb6b9e1406ae4fc57d36.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/230777b8687deb6b9e1406ae4fc57d36.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/230777b8687deb6b9e1406ae4fc57d36.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aletheia: Prophecy of Perseus</strong> is a new RPG that puts you in control of the legendary hero as he embarks on his impossible quest - to slay the gorgon Medusa and fulfil his destiny!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A FAITHFUL ADAPTION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The tale of <strong>Perseus</strong>, slayer of Medusa and savior of Andromeda, is one of the most beloved stories in Greek mythology. Many poets celebrated it, and it was a great favourite in Ancient Greece.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We here at <strong>Absent Dragon</strong>\u00a0present an RPG\u00a0about Perseus that stays true to the original myth, drawing upon the works of Apollodorus, Hesiod, Pindar and other classical texts.\u00a0The game has been meticulously researched to ensure it\u2019s as faithful as possible not only to the tale of Perseus, but to Greek mythology as a whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/a704cb4692a3fc587daa733b964d5145.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/a704cb4692a3fc587daa733b964d5145.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/a704cb4692a3fc587daa733b964d5145.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>TURN-BASED COMBAT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engaging turn-based combat with an action-point economy. Avoid attacks of opportunity, position your party to outflank your foes, and use blessings from the gods to slaughter them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/dfdba5c8717a27df598c53fdb72bf224.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/dfdba5c8717a27df598c53fdb72bf224.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/dfdba5c8717a27df598c53fdb72bf224.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>REACTIVE QUESTING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive questing with multiple solutions. <strong>SNEAK</strong>, <strong>TALK</strong> or <strong>FIGHT</strong> your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/333beb23069288c14b375779284a6b73.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/333beb23069288c14b375779284a6b73.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/333beb23069288c14b375779284a6b73.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DETAILED CHARACTER CREATION</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed character creation. Determine your upbringing, background, skills and attributes. Will you be a hunter? Philosopher?\u00a0Wrestler? Something else?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/0ba3646d91d98f5d51d7e851f90d529d.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/0ba3646d91d98f5d51d7e851f90d529d.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/0ba3646d91d98f5d51d7e851f90d529d.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BECOME YOUR LEGEND</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perseus's adventure can end in multiple ways,  each a testament to your journey. Will Perseus return a hero, a king... or something else entirely?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/6df56a2ca7954282a15fa3d2cfb16e16.poster.avif?t=1763342320\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/6df56a2ca7954282a15fa3d2cfb16e16.webm?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/extras/6df56a2ca7954282a15fa3d2cfb16e16.mp4?t=1763342320\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Absent Dragon"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633220/9cbcb582dd5ffc90e356533da3df28fbc783939f/header.jpg?t=1763342320","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3633220/1764035101/da7aeef8b5eab6598edb2b6deaba11fe00ca5d33/1750406601/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747926089","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3633220/1764035101/da7aeef8b5eab6598edb2b6deaba11fe00ca5d33/1750406601/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747926089","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3633220/1764035101/da7aeef8b5eab6598edb2b6deaba11fe00ca5d33/1750406601/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747926089","id":257143453,"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143453/039db5e15e3613483fda003f083adb39786fcc5b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747926089"}],"name":"Aletheia: Prophecy of Perseus","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 (64-bit) or above<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> DX10 capable GPU<br></li><li><strong>